WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:04,110
Yishao, you also graduated from Qilin Military Academy, right?

2
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:05,190
Yes Commander

3
00:00:05,190 --> 00:00:06,390
me too

4
00:00:06,390 --> 00:00:09,630
Unexpectedly, Qilin’s new life trial can still be preserved to this day.

5
00:00:09,630 --> 00:00:11,550
I'm going to Tianjin to attend a conference

6
00:00:11,550 --> 00:00:12,990
Are you okay? Watch the live broadcast

7
00:00:12,990 --> 00:00:14,750
Pay attention to some good seedlings

8
00:00:14,750 --> 00:00:20,060
Work hard, kids.

9
00:00:20,060 --> 00:00:22,300
The future will be like today

10
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:39,330
Jian Jingyu, you still don’t worry about the alarm

11
00:00:39,330 --> 00:00:40,450
The alarm has been sucked down

12
00:00:40,450 --> 00:00:41,810
But I didn’t sink any further.

13
00:00:41,810 --> 00:00:43,090
I want to see if I can climb out

14
00:00:43,090 --> 00:00:45,410
It's just that everything around here is too soft. I can't help myself. Please help me find a way.

15
00:00:45,410 --> 00:00:47,890
Since no one comes to save me, it means I won’t die for the time being.

16
00:00:47,890 --> 00:00:49,770
The teacher also wanted him to struggle a little more.
